codex
The approved Phase 5–10 artifacts contain historical evaluation predictions, not true post-cutoff forecasts. I’m therefore adding a deliberately simple causal forecast section backed only by the observed target prefix: selectable last-observation and 7-day seasonal-naive strategies, recursively extended beyond the final observed date. Future downloads will contain only `Date`, `forecast`, and method—never an `actual` column—while the existing evaluation window and metrics remain a separate historical-results section.
