codex
The first focused run found one UI-test ordering assumption (Streamlit enumerates main-page widgets before sidebar widgets) and a pandas date-offset deprecation warning. I’m correcting both, and I’m strengthening the causality test by giving the forecast function an explicit origin: even if a caller supplies rows after that origin, they are filtered before forecasting, so mutating those future targets cannot change output.
