+- Historical CSV/Excel names are explicitly evaluation outputs. Future CSV uses
+  only Date, forecast, and method; it cannot expose future actuals or residuals.
+- UI copy and app documentation distinguish historical evaluation from future
+  forecasting and disclose the simple forecast methodology.
+- Added tests for horizon length/prefix consistency, exact future date alignment,
+  recursive seasonal values, immunity to mutated post-origin targets, export
+  schema, and both separately labeled Streamlit controls.
