+  tests/test_phase11_dashboard.py
+  Result: return code 0
+- git diff --check
+  Result: return code 0
+
+Methodology and permissions
+- Forecasts use only target observations dated at or before the displayed origin.
+- No future actual values, locked-test tuning, external data, or fabricated
+  metrics/results are used.
+- No permission-gated action, deployment, push, destructive operation, scraping,
+  credential use, paid service, or fundamental methodology change was performed.
